{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e7c91a81669cf749","name":"Lancer-Class Frigate","source":{"id":"source:reference-e7c91a81669cf749","title":"Lancer-Class Frigate","revision":18734,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:38:44Z","sha256":"0f99e9380924fa2981b4fcf8e6a5e8a481d84b6e5f13b4827984cc0f1a039265","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18734","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Lancer-Class%20Frigate&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e7c91a81669cf749","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["After the Imperial defeat at the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yavin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yavin"},", Naval Command developed the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lancer"]},"-Class Frigate as an antifighter escort for larger ships that might be susceptible to the Alliance's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," tactics. Although it is the size of a light cruiser, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lancer"]},"-Class was designed to destroy small ships at close range. Early ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lancers"]}," were plagued with severe fire control malfunctions that could shut down more than half of the ship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"},", making the craft less than useless.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Overall, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lancer"]},"-Class was eventually considered a failure by Imperial command. Because the ship was too expensive to see much more than sporadic deployment within the Imperial Fleet, the majority of ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lancers"]}," are assigned to planetary defense  and rear guard actions. Despite this, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grand Admiral Thrawn"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grand_Admiral_Thrawn"}," employed the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lancer's"]}," capabilities to excellent effect, using them to raid New Republic worlds that were largely equipped with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"-based defenses.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though no specific ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lancers"]}," in the Imperial Navy have distinguished themselves, one frigate- captured by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"},"- has been made famous by its success. The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Fowler"]},", a late-model ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lancer"]},"-Class captured by Alliance forces near ",{"tag":"a","children":["Malastare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Malastare","referenceId":"reference:24e52a80d2db21d2"},", was put into service as an anti-",{"tag":"a","children":["TIE Fighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/TIE_Fighter","referenceId":"reference:726e84ae35ac767c"}," platform. Retrofitted with an improved ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"},", The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Fowler"]}," was sent on strike missions, providing cover for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Y-Wing Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Y-Wing_Starfighters"},". In its role as an antistarfighter platform, the Rebel ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lancer"]}," racked up an impressive number of kills, surviving long enough to be decommissioned after the formation of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Because it is slower than its intended targets, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lancer"]},"-Class Frigate is unable to actively seek out and engage enemy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," on its own. Instead, it is used by the Empire as a picket vessel, deployed on the outskirts of a fleet's perimeter. The ship's excellent capabilities in an antistarfighter role are perhaps its greatest weakness when it comes against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"},". The relatively light ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"}," it is equipped with cannot compete with the armor and shields of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"},". Likewise, the range of capital-scale weaponry far exceeds that of the weapons the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lancer"]},"-Class employs, thus guaranteeing that it is an easy target when pitted against them.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Lancer"]},"-Class Frigate Statistics (CL 14)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal (Frigate) ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -3; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," 